&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:27pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ｂ．受注実績&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;当事業年度の受注実績をセグメントごとに示すと、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:18pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:463.6pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
